  summary: I wonder if he's trying to tell me something more than just about the
    camera... Maybe he wants me to understand the connection between technology and
    nature, like how they can complement each other.
  entries:
  - I wonder what's behind his jokes... is he really just trying to make us happy
    or is there something more?
  - I wonder if he has any idea how much his words mean to me right now...
  - Hmm, I wonder if he's trying to tell me something more than just about the camera...
    Maybe he wants me to understand the connection between technology and nature,
    like how they can complement each other.
